{
  "post": {
    "id": "9322963",
    "published": "2016-08-11T05:58:14.000Z",
    "title": "山の日なので…！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/9322963.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160812090132/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/9322963.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "f4174c1c2bee.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/4/0/40387c11.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今年から新しい祝日「山の日」がはじまりましたね。出不精な鹿乃ですがかなり重い腰をあげて、山っぽいところに行ってきました( ˊᵕˋ* )"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "今年开始有了新的节日“山之日”呢。平时懒得出门的鹿乃，这次也难得地费了好大劲挪动身子，去了一趟颇有山野气息的地方( ˊᵕˋ* )"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A new national holiday, \"Mountain Day\", started this year, didn't it? I'm a bit of a homebody, but I summoned up a lot of effort and went somewhere mountain-ish( ˊᵕˋ* )"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "写真は山の中のお茶屋さん！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "照片里是山里的一家茶屋！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The photo is a tea house in the mountains!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "853d146ea579.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/3/1/3146dbc1.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "東京にいると意識しないとあまり虫の声や風の音を聴くことはないのですが、自然にすーっと入ってきました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "住在东京的话，不特意去留意，几乎听不到虫鸣和风声；可在这里，它们却自然而然地、轻轻地流淌进来了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In Tokyo you rarely hear insects or the wind unless you make an effort to, but here the sounds just slipped right in naturally."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "かなりリフレッシュ＆リラックスできたような気がします。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "感觉身心都好好地refresh、放松了一番。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I feel like I got really refreshed and relaxed."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "元々、ド田舎育ちなので自分が思っていたより東京の生活に疲れていたのかもしれないですね。ホームシック…( ¯•ω•¯ )"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我本来就是在乡下长大的，说不定比我自己以为的还要更疲惫于东京的生活呢。有点想家了……( ¯•ω•¯ )"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I grew up out in the sticks, so maybe I was more tired of life in Tokyo than I realized. Homesick…( ¯•ω•¯ )"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そんなこんなで連日暑い日が続いているので熱中症に注意しながら、みんなもお散歩？してみてはいかがでしょうか！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "就这样，最近连日酷暑，大家在注意别中暑的同时，要不要也去“散个步”试试看呢！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Anyway, it's been hot day after day, so while watching out for heatstroke, why don't you all go out for a little walk too!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ではでは、鹿乃でしたっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么那么，以上就是鹿乃啦"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Okay then, that was Kano!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "因为是山之日…！",
    "titleEn": "Because it's Mountain Day…!"
  },
